---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cozy Cauldron Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Cozy Cauldron, the iOS potion-brewing game by Dustin Gamble."
>
  <section class="prose section-block">
    <p><a href="/projects/cozy-cauldron/">&larr; Back to Cozy Cauldron</a></p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy for Cozy Cauldron</h1>
    <p>
      Effective date: March 9, 2026
    </p>

    <p>
      Cozy Cauldron does not collect, store, or share personal data with the developer.
    </p>
    <p>
      The app stores gameplay progress and the player's chosen name locally on the device.
    </p>
    <p>
      If local multiplayer is used, the app uses the local network only to connect nearby devices for
      gameplay. This information is not collected by the developer.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cozy Cauldron does not use third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cozy Cauldron does not require account creation and does not include in-app purchases.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact Dustin Gamble at
      <a href="mailto:dustin.e.gamble@gmail.com">dustin.e.gamble@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Copyright and Content Rights</h2>
    <p>
      &copy; 2026 Dustin Gamble. All rights reserved.
    </p>
    <p>
      All content in Cozy Cauldron, including code, artwork, UI text, screenshots, and promotional
      materials, is original to the developer or used with appropriate permission.
    </p>

    <h2>App Store Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Primary category: Games</li>
      <li>Recommended subcategories: Simulation and Family</li>
      <li>App Privacy: Data Not Collected</li>
      <li>Tracking: No Tracking</li>
      <li>Account creation: Not required</li>
      <li>In-app purchases: None</li>
      <li>Suggested age rating: 4+</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Age Rating Guidance</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Violence: None</li>
      <li>Mature or suggestive themes: None</li>
      <li>Profanity or crude humor: None</li>
      <li>Horror or fear themes: None</li>
      <li>Alcohol, tobacco, or drug use or reference: None</li>
      <li>Medical or wellness topics: None</li>
      <li>Simulated gambling: None</li>
      <li>Contests: None</li>
      <li>User-generated content: No</li>
      <li>Messaging or chat: No</li>
      <li>Advertising: No</li>
      <li>Unrestricted web access: No</li>
      <li>Parental controls: No</li>
      <li>Age assurance: No</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

